ion"],[1246,"`role=\"radio\"` on each segment"],[1086,"`role=\"radiogroup\"` on the container"],[1245,"`role=\"radiogroup\"` on the container"],[1604,"`selectionMode=\"multiple\"` → `role=\"toolbar\"` on container, `role=\"button\"` + `aria-pressed` per item"],[1603,"`selectionMode=\"single\"` → `role=\"radiogroup\"` on container, `role=\"radio\"` + `aria-checked` per item"],[797,"`size` controls item density. Shown here as two standalone menus so both\nsizes are visible at once; in practice you set `size` on the `Menu` inside a\n`MenuTrigger`."],[1493,"`size` is the tier: the eyebrow reads it on the `detail` ramp, the title on `heading`,\nand the body on `body`. Use `2xl` for a page title, `xl` for a hero, `lg` for a section\ntitle, and `md` (the default) everywhere else."],[539,"`slot=\"title\"` inside a `Modal` or `Dialog` sets the accessible name."],[1903,"`sm` - Small spacing"],[46,"`Space` / `Enter`"],[1349,"`Space` toggles the switch when it has focus"],[1024,"`status` is independent of timeline and only controls the status icon and (for `error`) the accent bar color."],[44,"`Tab`"],[392,"`Tab`"],[421,"`Tab`"],[712,"`Tab`"],[860,"`Tab`"],[1650,"`Tab`"],[1396,"`Tab`: `data-selected`, `data-hovered`, `data-pressed`, `data-focus-visible`, and `data-disabled`."],[1393,"`TabList` must be rendered inside `Tabs` and must provide `aria-label` or `aria-labelledby`. Give each `Tab` and its corresponding `TabPanel` the same `id`; React Aria uses that key to build their accessible relationship."],[1397,"`TabPanel`: `data-inert` when a force-mounted inactive panel is not interactive."],[1395,"`Tabs`: `data-design=\"underline\"` or `data-design=\"manilla\"`."],[1468,"`TextArea` is the multiline control inside a field, not a field on its own. Prefer `TextField` as the parent; see that component for fuller examples."],[1498,"`TextLockup` positions and type-sets its parts; you supply them. That means anything else can\nsit alongside them — a call to action, a second paragraph